sukut (0.4.0~beta.3-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Sidebar: its show/hide button is in the sidebar's own header, and in the
    page header only while the sidebar is hidden (GNOME's sidebar icon).
  * Audio page: the Start and Audio mode column is the wider one; Playback
    keeps a fixed width beside it and full width when stacked.

