sukut (0.4.0~beta.2-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Fix: Start no longer closes Sukut. PipeWire's real-time data thread is
    off for Sukut's connection; the processing thread keeps its priority.
  * Phone: "no permissions" phones get an Allow access button (one polkit
    prompt), a udev rule for any ADB phone, and no terminal instructions.
    adb and pkexec are now dependencies. Android 0.4.2's activation script.
  * Window, following Windows 0.4: Audio mode in its own panel, help at the
    top right, one refresh beside Audio output, a divider before Source app,
    more space above the buffering choices, display icons for monitors.
  * Sidebar button in the header bar; the Standby text no longer moves the
    layout; English uses the desktop font, Arabic a larger IBM Plex Sans Arabic.

 -- الطرفية <altarafiyah@gmail.com>  Sat, 31 Oct 2026 18:59:37 +0800

